   "#phonetips",
   "#techexplained",
   "#smartphonetips"
  ],
  "sources": [
   {
    "url": "https://support.apple.com/en-us/108039",
    "note": "Apple Support, About splash, water, and dust resistance of iPhone: IP68 under IEC 60529, maximum depth of 6 meters up to 30 minutes (iPhone 16 and later); avoid swimming, showering (pressurized or high velocity water), saunas and steam rooms, intentional submerging; resistance is not permanent and might decrease with normal wear; liquid damage not covered under warranty; resistant to accidental spills (read 13 Nov 2026)"
   },
   {
    "url": "https://www.iec.ch/ip-ratings",
    "note": "IEC, IP ratings (IEC 60529): first digit 6 = dust tight, second digit 8 = continuous immersion beyond 1 m under conditions the manufacturer specifies (not reachable from the build session; the standard's digit meanings)"
   }
  ]
 }
